      ],
      "updated": 1776232932285,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10m / day * 365 = 3650M / year      =      3.65 B / year\nlets assume we want to support service for 100years\n3.65B * 100 = 365B unique urls\n\nuse chars like 0-9, a-z, A-Z\nthats total 62 chars\n\nhow many chars require to statisfy this 365 B unique URLs ??  \n\n1 char = 62 possibilities = round of to 60\n2 chars = 3600 possibilities = round of to 4k\n3 chars = 240k possibilities\n.\n.\n6 chars = 56 B\n7 chars = 3.5 T\n\n\nso we need min 7 chars to sustain for 100 years with scale of 10m / unique urls ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "10m / day * 365 = 3650M / year      =      3.65 B / year\nlets assume we want to support service for 100years\n3.65B * 100 = 365B unique urls\n\nuse chars like 0-9, a-z, A-Z\nthats total 62 chars\n\nhow many chars require to statisfy this 365 B unique URLs ??  \n\n1 char = 62 possibilities = round of to 60\n2 chars = 3600 possibilities = round of to 4k\n3 chars = 240k possibilities\n.\n.\n6 chars = 56 B\n7 chars = 3.5 T\n\n\nso we need min 7 chars to sustain for 100 years with scale of 10m / unique urls ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2xtUjZwZ1nzK9Wciqa4TI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4304.659424433372,
      "y": -1296.0901607107712,
      "width": 669.8157958984375,
      "height": 315,
